"TTS synthesis failed.\n"
"\n"
"Could not generate audio file.\n"
"\n"
"Common causes:\n"
"• The TTS engine is not installed\n"
"• /tmp or /var is full (reboot to clear)\n"
"• Insufficient free memory"
msgstr ""
"La synthèse TTS a échoué.\n"
"\n"
"Impossible de générer le fichier audio.\n"
"\n"
"Causes courantes :\n"
"• Le moteur TTS n'est pas installé\n"
"• /tmp ou /var est plein (redémarrez pour effacer)\n"
"• Mémoire libre insuffisante"

